    "detailed_description": "Uh-Oh! is an Open-World Survival game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is no mandatory goal, so you can set your own goals by playing as a survivor in a single-player or multiplayer experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, you're probably going to face environmental challenges. Try to survive for as long as you can.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order to do that, you can scavenge for valuable resources, hunt, craft, build and fortify a base and, desirably, take some friends with you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you find someone else around, you can even try to make new friends. But be advised... whenever you try that, you're risking being betrayed over whatever you're carrying with you.",
